# IMPORTANT: unlike .gitignore, this file does not add to Wrangler's default
# ignore behaviour — it REPLACES it. Confirmed by an actual failed deploy:
# the moment this file existed (even listing just the videos below), Wrangler
# stopped implicitly skipping .git and tried to upload a 329 MiB pack file
# from it. So every directory that must never be served as a public asset has
# to be listed here explicitly, not just whatever caused today's failure.

# Never a public asset, whatever it contains.
.git/
.wrangler/

# The API's source code and internal tooling — deployed separately to
# Railway, not part of the marketing site. netlify.toml's _redirects
# already bounces a direct visitor away from these paths, but there's no
# reason to upload them as assets in the first place.
server/
tools/
site-server/
package.json
package-lock.json
README-PORTAL.md
DOCUMENTATIE-TEHNICA.md

# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets refuses any file over 25 MiB. These four
# videos exceed that (confirmed by an actual failed deploy, not a guess) and
# are excluded from what gets published here — they stay in git untouched.
# The pages that reference them (testimoniale.html,
# medical-park-bahcelievler-hospital.html, stomatologie.html) will show a
# missing video until these move to Cloudflare R2, which was already the
# planned home for the site's video regardless of this size limit.
materials/videos/sahin-ulu-video-1_4.mp4
materials/videos/whatsapp-video-2025-04-14-at-4.03.01-pm.mp4
materials/videos/img_1395.mov
materials/videos/medicross-prezentare.mp4
